      <activity id="e7a7d13e-8912-5335-9bbe-c99e472307e8" activityNameId="595ec230-60d8-5fd5-ac7c-edf71790bdba" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, ventilation equipment, Twl-700</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, ventilation equipment, Twl-700
Disposal of the ventilation unit for decentral ventilation systems with 700 m3/h maximal air flow. Housing mainly made of galvanised steel insulated with rock wool. Heat recovery element made of aluminium. Total weight of component 120 kg;
UUID: 124579a2-f40e-40b1-976a-e3fd61d41e4b
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_124579a2-f40e-40b1-976a-e3fd61d41e4b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
